---
import { MILESTONES } from '../../data/milestones';
import { type Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}

const { locale = 'es' } = Astro.props;
const milestone = MILESTONES[5];
---

<section 
  id="scene-6" 
  class="scene" 
  data-scene="paris" 
  data-year={milestone.year}
  data-pi-value={milestone.precisionValue}
  data-theme={milestone.theme}
  data-scene-title={milestone.title[locale]}
>
  <div class="stage">
    <!-- Narrative Center (Uncollapsible, balanced typography) -->
    <div class="narrative">
      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.05-0.38">
        <span class="scene-kicker">06 // PARÍS, 1777 d.C. · CONDE DE BUFFON</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">{milestone.title[locale]}</h2>
        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'En su salón parisino, Georges-Louis Leclerc, Conde de Buffon, descubrió algo casi sobrenatural: si arrojas agujas de coser al azar sobre un suelo de tablones de madera y cuentas cuántas cruzan las juntas entre tablas, π emerge de la nada sin un solo círculo a la vista.'
            : 'In his Parisian salon, Georges-Louis Leclerc, Count of Buffon, discovered something almost supernatural: toss sewing needles at random upon a floor of wooden parquet and count how many cross the seams between boards, and π emerges out of nowhere with not a single circle in sight.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.42-0.80">
        <span class="scene-kicker">06 // LA PROBABILIDAD GEOMÉTRICA</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">El Teorema del Suelo de Parquet</h2>
        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'La probabilidad exacta de cruce es 2L / (π · D). Con agujas de longitud L = D/2, basta dividir el doble de agujas entre los cruces para ver a π converger en vivo delante de tus ojos.'
            : 'The exact probability of crossing is 2L / (π · D). With needles of length L = D/2, simply dividing twice the needles by crossings reveals π converging live before your eyes.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beat beat-climax" data-beat="0.84-0.98">
        <blockquote class="buffon-quote">
          <p>«π ya no pertenecía solo a los círculos. Estaba escondido en el tejido mismo del azar.»</p>
          <cite>— Essai d’arithmétique morale (1777)</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Live Buffon Math Dashboard -->
    <div class="buffon-dashboard">
      <div class="stat-pill">
        <span class="stat-lbl">AGUJAS CAÍDAS (N):</span>
        <strong id="buffon-total" class="stat-val">0</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-pill">
        <span class="stat-lbl">CRUCES DE TABLA (C):</span>
        <strong id="buffon-cross" class="stat-val stat-cyan">0</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-pill stat-highlight">
        <span class="stat-lbl">ESTIMACIÓN π ≈ (2·L·N)/(D·C):</span>
        <strong id="buffon-pi-val" class="stat-val stat-gold">---</strong>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Canvas for falling needles -->
    <div class="canvas-container">
      <canvas id="buffon-canvas" class="buffon-canvas"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { BuffonSimulation } from '../../scripts/buffon';

  const canvas = document.getElementById('buffon-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement | null;
  if (canvas) {
    new BuffonSimulation(canvas);
  }
</script>

<style>
  .scene {
    height: 380vh;
    position: relative;
    --p: 0;
  }

  .stage {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #1b1713 0%, #090706 100%);
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  /* Uncollapsible Narrative Box */
  .narrative {
    position: absolute;
    top: 9vh;
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: min(90vw, 740px) !important;
    margin: 0 auto !important;
    text-align: center !important;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .beat {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translate3d(0, 16px, 0);
    transition: opacity 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 100% !important;
  }

  .beat.is-active {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .scene-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #00ffcc;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .scene-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.8vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
  }

  .beat-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.8vw, 1.12rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
  }

  .buffon-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.8vw, 1.9rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: #ffd700;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .buffon-quote cite {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-style: normal;
    color: #00ffcc;
    margin-top: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .buffon-dashboard {
    position: absolute;
    top: 26vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    z-index: 6;
  }

  .stat-pill {
    background: rgba(24, 20, 16, 0.9);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .stat-highlight {
    border-color: rgba(255, 208, 0, 0.35);
    background: rgba(32, 26, 18, 0.9);
  }

  .stat-lbl {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .stat-val {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .stat-cyan {
    color: #00ffcc;
  }

  .stat-gold {
    color: #ffd700;
    text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .canvas-container {
    position: relative;
    width: min(92vw, 760px);
    height: 360px;
    margin-top: 17vh;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 163, 115, 0.3);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #14110d;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .buffon-canvas {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
  }
</style>
